posal for the plan:

1. Update all AEO procedures by 30 October.
2. Walk the Rotterdam yard with the security checklist, one walk in week 42.
3. Complete the training records for everyone with access to the secured area=
s.
4. Mock audit on 24 November, so we still have time to fix findings before th=
e real audit on 9 December.

The documents go to the customs test team by 20 November. Mark, are you ok wi=
th 24 Nov for the mock audit? I would ask Hanna's EWM people to keep that wee=
k free of go-live activities in Rotterdam.

